        	<span style="font-size:22px;font-weight:bolder;">Personal Reminders</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;
        	<span style="color:#CDBFE3;font-size:14px;">C.P Bazar, Sirsi (Uttara Kannada)</span>
        </div>
        <br>
